Refreshing them, from Packages/DesignSystem/Vendor/fonts/:

  D=../../Sources/DesignSystem/Resources/Fonts
  R=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/fonts/main/ofl
  curl -fL "$R/onest/Onest%5Bwght%5D.ttf" -o "$D/Onest-VariableFont_wght.ttf"
  for w in Light Regular Medium; do
    curl -fL "$R/dmmono/DMMono-$w.ttf" -o "$D/DMMono-$w.ttf"
  done
  curl -fL "$R/onest/OFL.txt"  -o "$D/OFL-Onest.txt"
  curl -fL "$R/dmmono/OFL.txt" -o "$D/OFL-DMMono.txt"

Then update the commit, versions and hashes above, run the DesignSystem tests
(they render each token and compare it with the family positioned on its own
axis, so a bad file fails loudly), and check THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md still says
what these files are.
